ssed with defeating Pinochle, and the Klondikes, the infamous Mafia family, stand in the way of the gang.\n\nA frenzied battle amongst these card obsessed players, fueled by justice, desire, and revenge, is about to begin!"},"tags":[{"name":"Super Power","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Card Battle","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":68,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Cars","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Orphan","rank":63,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Police","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mafia","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Poker","rank":51,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gambling","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Dissociative Identities","rank":40,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Detective","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Conspiracy","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Fake Relationship","rank":20,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Boys' Love","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"HIGH CARD","english":"HIGH CARD","native":"HIGH CARD","romaji":"HIGH CARD","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"至高之牌"}]},"trailer":{"id":"SX9O1WJMrbA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SX9O1WJMrbA/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}